{
  "table": "ActionBindings",
  "version": 2,
  "rows": [
    // One fixed layout per class (backlog E, spec 9.6; kits in docs/design/skills-m1-proposal.md). Inputs (R-2.2-01):
    // left click the class's normal attack, Ctrl the dodge, right click the parry. skillSlots by input slot number:
    // 1-6 are keys 1-6, 7 Q, 8 E, 9 R, 10 F, 11 Z; "" leaves a slot empty (a press is refused with SkillNotLearned).
    // The kits use Q E R F and 1.

    // Warrior: Slash (Q), Head Cut (E), Piercing Attack (R), Jump Strike (F). Slot 1 (Stamina buff) comes with the
    // statuses (wave 5).
